{
  "_comment": "Second worked example: triple-negative breast cancer. Demonstrates that retargeting the profiler to a new disease means editing this file and the researcher CSV -- no code changes. 'Triple Negative Breast Neoplasms' is the exact MeSH heading; the text_terms catch papers too new to be MeSH-indexed yet.",

